Z||000004||FieroFanaticus2||05-17-2001||04:10 PM||||The front bumper came that way when I bought it, I like it sharp and pointy like that though so I am happy  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Those are seat covers in there, just put them on the other day and have had many compliments on them already  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>The rear wing will be going on tonight!  Just gotta get to the hardware store for a drill bit.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>And am waiting for the scoops to get here, ordered them from ferarri momo last friday.<P>Grant sells horn buttons with the pontiac symbol, was thinking about getting one and replacing the one that is shown in the pics, but think it might make it look kind of cheesy - what do you think?||||reg||1
