Z||000006||spideyfoot||05-17-2001||05:42 PM||||You can only get a red leather shift knob if you ditch the taz mats. Watch out fiero uses a big holed knob. Most of the Ricer knobs wont work. I spent $60 on a Carbon fiber knob now it lives in my wife's Mustang. I think we are 16 mm. Get a MOMO with matching Boot ( Have to get a Rodney boot ring though. Hey MOMO makes floormats also but stitched Fiero ones are the coolest I like the red ones in a red car but I've only seen that on a black carpet. I guess it would look good on grey.<p>[This message has been edited by spideyfoot (edited 05-17-2001).]||||reg||1
